Tool output

The Vivado and Vitis HLS reports and logs in this repository are output of AMD tools, included as records of our
builds. Any AMD notices they contain apply to them.

Data

The recorded readout traces are the public dataset of the reference work, Zenodo record 14427490
(https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14427490), under the licence stated on that record. This repository contains labels,
manifests and results derived from it, not the traces themselves.
